{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"X\",\"small\":\"X\",\"core\":\"X\",\"concise\":\"X\",\"human\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\",\"load\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"big：X的大字能串出具体的关系因果：想靠近、怕给对方负担、对方没有退开、因此既放松又舍不得；Y的大字较多落在抽象的自我状态上。small：X的小字和感受更常补足当屏的处境与身体体验，能挂回关系主线；Y有些小块重复大字，还有从“我”突然跳到“他”的指代不一致。core：X始终围绕亲密带来的幸福与留不住它的痛楚推进，Y也涉及两者，但更容易被泛化的情绪概念带走。concise：X虽然有回环，但大多是在推进关系阶段；Y在“舒服、投入、留稳、松下来”等意思上多次换词重说。human：X的“怕对方嫌自己太黏”“心里空落落”等符合日常说话习惯；Y的“反过来碰触这份确定”“容下更宽一些的感受”“阶段性的满足”等搭配偏生硬、抽象。fine：X留下了“还没失去就先舍不得”“白天相处很好，独处时心头泛酸”等具体体验；Y较常用“失衡、满足、清透轻盈”等概括性表达。load：X每屏主要扫几段较短的高亮词组，数量与停留时间相称；Y每屏多块整段大字，尤其S04、S06、S11、S13，在有限时间内累积的阅读量明显更大。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "55a7a1ab-70ee-4671-9fa1-60ac373a7a2a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T153113834201Z", "elapsed_seconds": 207.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:34:40.905403+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "69f141be619b573c0ce3a68d6fd3484c336abe05e78d403deb339999ed27fdb1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b